.TH GUESSGAME 1 "2026-01-22" "1.0" "Guessing Game Script"
.SH NAME
guessgame \- simple number guessing game script
.SH SYNOPSIS
./guessgame.sh
.SH DESCRIPTION
Generates a random number within a user-defined range and prompts the user to guess it.
Keeps track of attempts and congratulates the user when guessed correctly.
.SH USAGE
1. Run the script:
       ./guessgame.sh
2. Enter minimum and maximum numbers when prompted.
3. Keep guessing until you find the number.
.SH OPTIONS
None. The script is fully interactive.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 if the user guessed the number.
1 if the input range is invalid.
.SH AUTHOR
Shazil
